 "answer": "The minimum NVIDIA driver version for Ollama on Windows is **551.61**. The Windows system requirements say: \"NVIDIA 551.61 or newer Drivers if you have an NVIDIA card\" [ollama/docs/windows.md].\n\nThe general Nvidia hardware page gives different numbers: \"Ollama supports Nvidia GPUs with compute capability 5.0+ and driver version 550 and newer.\" [ollama/docs/gpu.md] It also says: \"Nvidia GPUs with compute capability 5.0 through 6.2 require driver version 570 or newer.\" [ollama/docs/gpu.md]\n\nThe Windows-specific figure is the one that applies to Windows, but the documents don't explain the discrepancy.",
